# Frontend

- Routes: `/` case list, `/cases/new` intake, `/cases/[id]` investigation/drafts/resolution/activity, `/picklists`, `/settings`.
- One case screen shows status, severity, investigation, notes, drafts, and resolution. Save drafts through the API.
- Copy controls paste into Slack/Salesforce. The app does not send Gmail or Slack.
- Use the API base from `NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL`. Show empty, loading, and error states for cases and picklists.
- Meet 4.5:1 contrast, 44px targets, visible focus, and a label on every input.
